  "outstanding": [
    "Global Artin reciprocity and the prescribed finite-quotient degree-one Chebotarev theorem are selected inputs to CFR-01. The modular-form expansion theorem, integral Fourier expansions of E₄³ and Δ, classification of determinant-q matrices and integrality of the singular modulus are used through their named suppliers. The residue congruence itself is derived in the archive.",
    "The complete unramified field, its arithmetic Frobenius lift, the preliminary residue-field lift and Hensel approximation are invoked at the indicated lemmas. CME derives integrality of the curve endomorphism and HTC traces its use in the height-two functional equation."
  ],
